(2) Any paint gun, slingshots, bow and arrow, crossbow, blowgun or similar projectile repelling utensil;
(3) Any burglar tools;
(4) Any rifle, shotgun, BB gun, air gun, spring gun, sling-shot, bow or other weapon in which the propelling force is gunpowder, a spring or air.
(Code 2003, § 93.22; Ord. of 4-15-2002)

